{"text":"kuruntokai","n":75,"lines":["நீகண் டனையோ கண்டார்க் கேட்டனையோ","ஒன்று தௌிய நசையினம் மொழிமோ","வெண்கோட் டியானை சோணை படியும்","பொன்மலி பாடலி பெறீஇயர்","யார்வாய்க் கேட்டனை காதலர் வரவே"],"tr":["nīkaṇ ṭaṉaiyō kaṇṭārk kēṭṭaṉaiyō","oṉṟu tauya nacaiyiṉam moḻimō","veṇkōṭ ṭiyāṉai cōṇai paṭiyum","poṉmali pāṭali peṟīiyar","yārvāyk kēṭṭaṉai kātalar varavē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"marutam","tinai_ta":"மருதம்","speaker_ta":"தலைவி கூற்று","poet_ta":"படுமரத்து மோசிகீரனார்","speaker_en":"the heroine (talaivi)","poet_tr":"Paṭumarattu Mōcikīraṉār"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"5 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"4×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 18, veṇcīr 1"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 10, veṇṭaḷai 8"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"நீகண்","tr":"nīkaṇ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நீ","tr":"nī"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கண்","tr":"kaṇ"}]},{"text":"டனையோ","tr":"ṭaṉaiyō","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"டனை","tr":"ṭaṉai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யோ","tr":"yō"}]},{"text":"கண்டார்க்","tr":"kaṇṭārk","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கண்","tr":"kaṇ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"டார்க்","tr":"ṭārk"}]},{"text":"கேட்டனையோ","tr":"kēṭṭaṉaiyō","foot":"kūviḷaṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கேட்","tr":"kēṭ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"டனை","tr":"ṭaṉai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யோ","tr":"yō"}]}],[{"text":"ஒன்று","tr":"oṉṟu","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"ஒன்","tr":"oṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"று","tr":"ṟu"}]},{"text":"தௌய","tr":"tauya","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தௌ","tr":"tau"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ய","tr":"ya"}]},{"text":"நசையினம்","tr":"nacaiyiṉam","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"நசை","tr":"nacai"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"யினம்","tr":"yiṉam"}]},{"text":"மொழிமோ","tr":"moḻimō","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மொழி","tr":"moḻi"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"மோ","tr":"mō"}]}],[{"text":"வெண்கோட்","tr":"veṇkōṭ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வெண்","tr":"veṇ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கோட்","tr":"kōṭ"}]},{"text":"டியானை","tr":"ṭiyāṉai","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"டியா","tr":"ṭiyā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னை","tr":"ṉai"}]},{"text":"சோணை","tr":"cōṇai","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"சோ","tr":"cō"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ணை","tr":"ṇai"}]},{"text":"படியும்","tr":"paṭiyum","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"படி","tr":"paṭi"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யும்","tr":"yum"}]}],[{"text":"பொன்மலி","tr":"poṉmali","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பொன்","tr":"poṉ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"மலி","tr":"mali"}]},{"text":"பாடலி","tr":"pāṭali","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பா","tr":"pā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"டலி","tr":"ṭali"}]},{"text":"பெறீஇயர்","tr":"peṟīiyar","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பெறீ","tr":"peṟī"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"இயர்","tr":"iyar"}]}],[{"text":"யார்வாய்க்","tr":"yārvāyk","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"யார்","tr":"yār"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வாய்க்","tr":"vāyk"}]},{"text":"கேட்டனை","tr":"kēṭṭaṉai","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கேட்","tr":"kēṭ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"டனை","tr":"ṭaṉai"}]},{"text":"காதலர்","tr":"kātalar","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கா","tr":"kā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"தலர்","tr":"talar"}]},{"text":"வரவே","tr":"varavē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"வர","tr":"vara"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வே","tr":"vē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"நீகண்","parts":[{"text":"நீகண்","lemma":"நீகண்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"டனையோ","parts":[{"text":"டனையோ","lemma":"டனையோ","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கண்டார்க்","parts":[{"text":"கண்டார்க்","lemma":"கண்டார்க்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கேட்டனையோ","parts":[{"text":"கேட்டனையோ","lemma":"கேட்டனையோ","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"ஒன்று","parts":[{"text":"ஒன்று","lemma":"ஒன்று","gloss":"one thing"}],"gloss":"one thing"},{"surface":"தௌிய","parts":[{"text":"தௌி","lemma":"தெளி","gloss":"be clear"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"அ","gloss":"infinitive suffix"}],"gloss":"clearly"},{"surface":"நசையினம்","parts":[{"text":"நசை","lemma":"நசை","gloss":"desire"},{"text":"இனம்","lemma":"இனம்","gloss":"we have"}],"gloss":"we who desire"},{"surface":"மொழிமோ","parts":[{"text":"மொழி","lemma":"மொழி","gloss":"speak"},{"text":"மோ","lemma":"மோ","gloss":"imperative particle"}],"gloss":"please speak"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வெண்கோட்","parts":[{"text":"வெண்கோட்","lemma":"வெண்கோட்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"டியானை","parts":[{"text":"டியானை","lemma":"டியானை","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"சோணை","parts":[{"text":"சோணை","lemma":"சோணை","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"படியும்","parts":[{"text":"படியும்","lemma":"படியும்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"பொன்","parts":[{"text":"பொன்","lemma":"பொன்","gloss":"gold"}],"gloss":"gold"},{"surface":"மலி","parts":[{"text":"மலி","lemma":"மலி","gloss":"abound"}],"gloss":"abounding"},{"surface":"பாடலி","parts":[{"text":"பாடலி","lemma":"பாடலி","gloss":"Pataliputra city"}],"gloss":"Pataliputra"},{"surface":"பெறீஇயர்","parts":[{"text":"பெறு","lemma":"பெறு","gloss":"obtain"},{"text":"ஈஇயர்","lemma":"இயர்","gloss":"optative suffix"}],"gloss":"to obtain"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"யார்","parts":[{"text":"யார்","lemma":"யார்","gloss":"who"}],"gloss":"who"},{"surface":"வாய்","parts":[{"text":"வாய்","lemma":"வாய்","gloss":"mouth"}],"gloss":"from whose mouth"},{"surface":"கேட்டனை","parts":[{"text":"கேட்டனை","lemma":"கேட்டனை","gloss":"did you hear"}],"gloss":"did you hear","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"காதலர்","parts":[{"text":"காதல்","lemma":"காதல்","gloss":"love"},{"text":"அர்","lemma":"அர்","gloss":"honorific suffix"}],"gloss":"lover"},{"surface":"வரவே","parts":[{"text":"வரவு","lemma":"வரவு","gloss":"coming"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis particle"}],"gloss":"the return indeed"}]}],"literal":"Did you see? Or did you hear from those who saw? / Speak, so that we may clearly know one thing, we who desire! / Where white-tusked elephants bathe in the Sone river, / to obtain gold-abounding Pataliputra, / from whose mouth did you hear of the return of our lover?","translation":"Did you see him yourself, or did you hear it from those who saw him? Speak, so that we who yearn may know the truth clearly! From whose mouth did you hear the news of our lover's return—he who went to acquire wealth as vast as the gold-abounding city of Pataliputra, where white-tusked elephants bathe in the Sone river?","modern":"நீயே அவரைப் பார்த்தாயா? அல்லது பார்த்தவர்களிடம் கேட்டாயா? நாங்கள் உண்மையை தெளிவாகத் தெரிந்துகொள்ள விரும்புகிறோம், சொல்வாயாக! வெண்மையான தந்தங்களை உடைய யானைகள் சோணை நதியில் நீராடும், பொன் வளம் மிக்க பாடலிபுத்திர நகரத்தைப் போன்ற பெரும் செல்வத்தைப் பெறுவதற்காகச் சென்ற நம் காதலரின் வருகையைப் பற்றி நீ யார் சொல்லக் கேட்டாய்?","explanation":"The heroine is speaking to her friend or a messenger who has brought news of the hero's return. Having suffered long in separation, she is filled with both hope and disbelief, demanding to know if the messenger saw him firsthand or heard it from others. The poem employs a grand historical and geographical allusion to the wealthy city of Pataliputra on the banks of the Sone river, where elephants bathe. This imagery emphasizes the immense wealth the hero went to acquire and elevates the scale of his successful quest. The tension between her deep desire and her need for absolute certainty drives the emotional core of the poem. Key words include 'காதலர் வரவே' (the return of the lover) and 'ஒன்று தெளிய' (to clarify one thing).","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}